# Customize features inventory

Canonical list: **`.cursor/customize-features.md`** (branding, i18n, encrypt session, background/tray, settings, per-platform UI, and what must not return from `main`).

When adding/removing customize product behavior, update that file in the same change set.
When porting from `main`, treat listed removals (terminal, pairing/trust, Devices page, `clientShell` / `clientDesktop` / `startHidden` / `allowNewPairings`) as hard skips unless the user explicitly asks otherwise. `keepAwake` is already on `develop` — do not treat it as a main-only skip.
